From: relay12 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dtl: replace ATL ownership helpers

Replace CComPtr and CComHeapPtr with relay12's shared, contract-tested
ownership layer. The thin DTL adapter preserves CComHeapPtr's CoTaskMemFree
contract without putting Windows APIs into the shared implementation.
---
